From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:01:13 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(v2): add bounded transaction pool and fenced
 reconciliation

Maintenance explanation added during mailbox export:
Add a bounded native ordinary transaction pool with TxID and TxHash lookup, dependency tracking, first accepted witness retention and authoritative-context reconciliation. Its standalone tests exercise real ordinary validation, resource policy and reorg handling; subsequent patches repair output collision lookup and incremental rebuilding.

